==Strategy==
Stall at the beginning with some Eraser Cats while you max out the Worker Cat and save up money. Once you have max money or until the Jackie Pengs die, send out your ranged attackers ([[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]], etc.) along with your meatshields. [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs]] or any other wave attacker will help chip away at Camelle over time. Any cats that outrange Camelle will help too. Treat this stage like the Crazed Cat stage, but easier. Since the boss has low range, anything that outranges it helps.

